<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Oct 3 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1996/97		  1997/98</p>
<p> South Korea  53,200			Nil</p>
<p> Japan	  23,300</p>
<p> Mexico	 20,100</p>
<p> Unknown a   -52,000</p>
<p>Exports of 126,500 tonnes were 13 percent above the previous week and 59 percent above four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: South Korea (53,200) and Mexico (35,400).</p>
</text>
